);
#suppress "@azure-tools/typespec-azure-core/no-legacy-usage" "Back compatibility"
@@Azure.ClientGenerator.Core.Legacy.flattenProperty(
  Microsoft.ServiceNetworking.PrivateLinkResource.properties,
  "autorest"
);
```

**[client.tsp:L162-L171](https://github.com/Azure/azure-rest-api-specs/blob/b1582b12f39f1d122fce3c7bbb24b812b0c5c487/specification/servicenetworking/resource-manager/Microsoft.ServiceNetworking/ServiceNetworking/client.tsp#L162-L171)**

